        "TXH-10"
      ],
      "state": "sourced",
      "notes": "3 years from the first payment date for an employee or self-employed individual who has reached retirement age, and for amounts used for the member's study. A study withdrawal in Israel of up to one third of the balance does not close the account if no such withdrawal was made in the preceding 12 months (s.9(16A)(b)). Which age in the Retirement Age Law applies is open question 5 (KH-12 infers s.3: 67 men, 65 women)."
    }
